{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و\n \n 日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38076RP0B0E0SCJH0XXM9E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 1ヶ月早めのサンタクロース。🎅\n 皆さんらまだ11月です！すみません！笑笑\n \n 因みに腕に付いている雪だるまちゃん⛄️\n サンタさんと一緒について来ました笑\n \n \n \n \n \n 昨日は、三枚目シングル初の個別握手会がパシフィコ横浜にて開催されました〜！🤝\n \n 寒い中きてくださった皆さんありがとうございました😊\n \n \n \n \n \n 1部と2部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3808944RZ1HBMZT2EMWJZ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 金村美玖のかえる、そらまめ〜。\n 見つけたので一緒に撮っちゃいました♡\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3809A1B94NHFV7DAAJ7AT9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 今回は金村と一緒にサンタのコスプレをしました！🎄\n \n 　\n 今年最後の個別握手会なので、一足早いクリスマス！！！\n 早くクリスマスにならないかな〜って思いました！\n あーーー！くりすますライブ楽しみ😆😆😆\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ380A9D3H450KK898CWJ4QR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n ハマっているツインテールにしました👧\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ380B9W1KVB1QZ3RXHGQMJC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n ファイト〜！？\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ380CADTAKE006K3DKV75PB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 謎写真。笑\n \n \n \n 3部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ380DBS4QJRTJB89WDZPZF2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ380ECDJNB8F0VRPN4ET9CA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 地味〜に違う写真📸\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ380FN55QCVZPDYKASPHC4R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 金村とショールームした時に方チェックのパジャマ🛏\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ380GNWCR01Y1XJWPXV9KPC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n チェックしちゃってごめんよ😭🙇🏻‍♀️\n 🧸\n \n \n \n 次のブログに続きます！\n \n \n \n \n \n 読んでいただきありがとうございました\n \n #295"}],"source":"archive"}